  "description": "Fall back and we’ll catch you. Trust, that’s what you’ll be getting with our Urban X2 Bike, a reliable new best friend, ready to perform for you in all conditions. With upgraded disc brakes and gearing, you’ll be in safe hands for your workplace commute and beyond.\nAs part of the Urban X range, Reid Urban X2 comes with hydraulic disc brakes for a faster ride with better control and performance in all conditions. As a reliable commuter, the Urban X2 will see you to the office and home with ease.\nSignificantly, designed with a relaxed urban geometry and featuring ergonomic grips, Reid Urban X2 is perfect for those with a longer commute. Also, it’s suitable for those looking for a versatile bike that can still crank out the miles on the weekend. With additional design features such as frame mounts for mudguards and pannier racks, the Urban X2 is suitable for all journeys.",
